<p>27.5% live birth</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Multiples (3%&#x02013;5%)</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 48px;">
                <td style="height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>IVF</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tubal factor, endometriosis, unexplained</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>40%&#x02013;50% live birth (&#x0003c;35)</p>
